                            when="1931-10-27">October 27, 1931</date>.<lb/>[Received 8:45
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>190. Department’s instruction 218 of October 15.<anchor n="44b" xml:id="d552-f1"
                    /> Permission granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaulac</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
